Vendor Runtimes Loaded From the Host
====================================

The Linux and macOS release archives and wheels do not include the
inference runtimes below. The binary loads each one from the host at
run time when it is installed there, and each remains under its own
vendor's license:

    ONNX Runtime (libonnxruntime) and its CUDA and QNN providers
    TensorFlow Lite (libtensorflow-lite) and the VX, Neutron and QNN
        delegates, loaded by the edgefirst-tflite crates
    NXP (Kinara) Ara-2 client library (libaraclient), loaded by the
        ara2 crate
    HailoRT (libhailort), reached through libedgefirst_hailort.so
    NVIDIA TensorRT (libnvinfer), reached through libtrt_shim.so
    Qualcomm AI Engine Direct (libQnnHtp)

